{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792502264, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}}
[0.011399, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.014414, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m  2 \u00b7 Fleet\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  recorded run \u00b7 Tue 20 Oct 2026, 15:17 CEST\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.015996, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Every GPU cluster is one Kubernetes object on the control plane, labelled with where it is \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.016029, "o", "\u001b[35m    and which jurisdiction it belongs to.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.018614, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Modelplane built both: the AKS cluster in Sweden Central and the Nebius cluster in Finland, \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.018648, "o", "\u001b[35m    each with its GPU pool and serving stack.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.01883, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 The hardware on offer: one InferenceClass per kind of node pool\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.01887, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl get inferenceclass \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.018896, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -o custom-columns=NAME:.metadata.name,DESCRIPTION:.spec.description,MEMORY:.spec.devices[0].capacity.memory.value\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.047534, "o", "  NAME      DESCRIPTION                                         MEMORY\r\n  a100-1x   AKS Standard_NC24ads_A100_v4, 1x NVIDIA A100 80GB   81920Mi\r\n  l40s-1x   Nebius gpu-l40s-a, 1x NVIDIA L40S 48GB              46068Mi\r\n"]
[0.048924, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.048956, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 The clusters that offer it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.048971, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl get inferencecluster -L modelplane.ai/region,jurisdiction\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.076298, "o", "NAME                SOURCE   GATEWAY          SYNCED   READY   AGE    REGION          JURISDICTION\r\n"]
[0.076345, "o", "aks-swedencentral   AKS      57.174.100.174   True     True    166m   swedencentral   eu\r\nnebius-eu-north     Nebius   89.169.122.75    True     True    166m   eu-north        eu\r\n"]
[0.077855, "o", "\u001b[2m  GATEWAY is each cluster's own mTLS entry point: the front door reaches its replicas through it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.077898, "m", "ENTER"]
[0.107746, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 What one object became in Azure\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.10779, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ crossplane resource trace inferencecluster/aks-swedencentral\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.12435, "o", "  NAME                                                               SYNCED  READY  STATUS\r\n"]
[1.813893, "o", "  InferenceCluster/aks-swedencentral                                 True    True   Available\r\n"]
[1.813968, "o", "  \u251c\u2500 AKSCluster/aks-swedencentral                                    True    True   Available\r\n  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 ResourceGroup/modelplane-system-aks-swedencentral-aks-97ae4  True    True   Available\r\n  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 KubernetesClusterNodePool/aks-swedencentral-ac91c5656a3d     True    True   Available\r\n  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 KubernetesCluster/modelplane-system-aks-swedencentral-aks-\u2026  True    True   Available\r\n  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 Object/aks-swedencentral-2c3d6f1b5bc9                        True    True   Available\r\n  \u2502  \u251c\u2500 Subnet/aks-swedencentral-1740b5dddd51                        True    True   Available\r\n  \u2502  \u2514\u2500 VirtualNetwork/aks-swedencentral-561d405218c5                True    True   Available\r\n  \u251c\u2500 ServingStack/aks-swedencentral-serving-stack-0dd9b              True    True   Available\r\n"]
[1.814002, "o", "  \u2502  \u2514\u2500 \u2026 15 Helm releases, 24 objects: the serving stack\r\n"]
[1.872009, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.872052, "m", "ENTER"]
[1.900475, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 The front door, on \u001b[2maks-swedencentral\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[33m: one per place requests enter\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.900525, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl get inferencegateway\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.927079, "o", "NAME   CLUSTER             ADDRESS           SYNCED   READY   AGE\r\n"]
[1.927141, "o", "eu     aks-swedencentral   172.160.123.204   True     True    166m\r\n"]
[1.958432, "o", "\u001b[2m  It serves ModelServices labelled jurisdiction=eu.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.95847, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[32m\ud83d\udca1 The platform team is done: capacity is published once, on two providers. ML teams self-serve from here.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
